WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
An export button is not an exit. Test whether exported data creates usable independence.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Map everything that must leave.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Preserve provenance and consent history.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Test readability in another system.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Protect exclusions and sensitive data.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Portability means usable independence.
